![screenshot of choco-cleaner-rt-libbad.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/endpoints/images/content/choco-cleaner-rt-libbad.hook_screenshot.png)

## Choco Cleaner RT for lib-bad deletes the Chocolatey lib-bad folder which contains Chocolatey packages that failed to install

**Choco Cleaner RT** (runtime/realtime - you choose) hooks are the natural evolution of my [Choco-Cleaner](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner/versions) script using hooks available in Chocolatey v1.2.0+. These hooks do micro cleansing by duplicating the features of **Choco Cleaner** before and after package installs, thus RT. No scheduling. No manually running anything. No need to edit a config file. Just install the choco-cleaner-rt-XXX.hook(s) you want. **Choco Cleaner RT** hooks run WHEN you install and update packages.

### NOTES:
* Recovered disk space will not be as dramatic as when running **Choco-Cleaner** since **Choco-Cleaner-RT** will be running far more often and you'll see smaller results on a per package basis.
* Some **Choco-Cleaner-RT** micro cleansing happens on previously installed packages instead of the current one due to technical restrictions; i.e. **choco-cleaner-rt-ignores.hook** can not delete .ignore files from the current package or Chocolatey will make shims for everything the packager didn't want shimmed.
* File deletion logging and toggling the displayed info off are possible via a config, see [choco-cleaner-rt](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt/versions) for more info.
* A few features of **Choco-Cleaner** are not going to be supported by CCRT such as orphaned shim checking and deleting of Chocolatey .log and .old files; if you want these features please use [Choco-Cleaner](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner/versions).

### Choco Cleaner RT Collection:
* [choco-cleaner-rt](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt/versions) - installs the most desirable hooks as dependencies and the optional config file
* [choco-cleaner-rt-archives.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-archives.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-chocolateycache.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-chocolateycache.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-desktopicons.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-desktopicons.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-dotchocolatey.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-dotchocolatey.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-ignores.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-ignores.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-libbad.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-libbad.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-libbkp.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-libbkp.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-licenses.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-licenses.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-msinstallers.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-msinstallers.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-nugetcache.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-nugetcache.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-nupkgs.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-nupkgs.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-readmes.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-readmes.hook/versions)
* [choco-cleaner-rt-startmenuicons.hook](https://nuts.bcurran3.org/feeds/chocolatey/choco-cleaner-rt-startmenuicons.hook/versions)

**If you find Choco-Cleaner-RT useful, and I suspect you will, please consider donating: https://www.paypal.me/bcurran3donations or become a patron at https://www.patreon.com/bcurran3**
